flowchart TD
    request[Traveler supplies trip and preferences] --> memory[Load session, current entities and bounded conversation]
    workflow[Load recent decisions, tool calls and outcomes] --> memory
    memory --> context[Stable cached instructions + changing memory suffix]
    context --> budget{Token threshold reached?}
    budget -- Yes --> compact[LLM summary + exact source archive]
    compact --> pointer[Memory ID and description]
    pointer --> loop[Raw Anthropic agent loop]
    budget -- No --> loop
    loop --> retrieval[Oracle HNSW retrieval → reranker]
    loop --> live[Tavily live flight, hotel and transport research]
    live --> offload[Compressed full response + bounded preview]
    offload --> workflow
    retrieval --> workflow
    loop --> unpack[Just-in-time unpack by memory ID]
    unpack --> archive[(Oracle scoped archive + checksum)]
    archive --> workflow
    loop --> summary[Grounded research shortlist and supplier links]
